# Secrets — never commit
.env
# ...and every variant: a `.env.bak` reached the PUBLIC remote on 2026-06-24 with
# real NCE_MASTER_KEY / NCE_API_KEY / MinIO / DSN values, because `.env` alone
# does not match `.env.bak`, `.env.local`, `.env.prod` etc.
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.template
mcp_config.json
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials.json
serviceAccountKey.json
deploy/compose.stack.env.generated
# Local overrides — track deploy/compose.stack.env.example instead (placeholders only).
deploy/compose.stack.env

