# Internal work docs — planning, prompts, audits, roadmaps (local only).
# Rule: code and code documentation belong on the remote; work documents never do.
# EVERYTHING under _internal/ is local-only, without exception — never force-add from it.
_internal/

# Legacy paths (content lives under _internal/work-docs/)
prompts/
# ...and any ARCHIVE of them: `prompts/` only matches a directory, so a zipped
# bundle of the same work docs slipped straight past it onto the public remote.
prompts.zip
prompts*.zip
**/prompts.zip
Instructions/
phase6-runners/

